WEBVTT

00:05:59.996 --> 00:06:02.996
She did it because she ran a country

00:06:02.996 --> 00:06:04.996
that had a national health service.

00:06:04.996 --> 00:06:07.996
So, if she didn't invest in effective prevention,

00:06:07.996 --> 00:06:09.996
she was going to have pick up the costs

00:06:09.996 --> 00:06:11.996
of treatment later on,

00:06:11.996 --> 00:06:13.996
and obviously those are much higher.

00:06:13.996 --> 00:06:16.996
So she was making a politically rational decision.

00:06:16.996 --> 00:06:18.996
Now, if I take out my

00:06:18.996 --> 00:06:20.996
public health nerd glasses here

00:06:20.996 --> 00:06:23.996
and look at these data,

00:06:23.996 --> 00:06:26.996
it seems like a no-brainer, doesn't it?

00:06:26.996 --> 00:06:28.996
But in this country,

00:06:28.996 --> 00:06:31.996
where the government apparently does not feel compelled